---
layout: changelog
title: "Sunsetting the Appwrite Education program"
date: 2026-11-04
cover: /images/changelog-local/2026-11-04.avif
tags: programs
---

On **December 1st, 2026**, Appwrite is sunsetting the Education program for verified [GitHub Student Developer Pack](https://education.github.com/pack) members. New enrollments will close, and existing Education organizations will move off Pro-level plan resources.

We are redirecting the time and budget spent running the program into **improvements to the Appwrite Cloud free plan** for all developers. Students and hobbyists who used the Education plan for coursework can keep building on Cloud within free plan limits, upgrade to [Pro](/pricing), or [self-host Appwrite](/docs/advanced/self-hosting) on their own infrastructure.

Before December 1st, we will contact active Education organizations with a transition timeline and support for moving projects.

